# Pinned Zig toolchain for cragd (docs/03 §4, docs/06 §3).
# The build container (container/Containerfile) installs exactly this
# release from ziglang.org; keep the ARG ZIG_VERSION there in sync.
#
# 0.17.1 released 2026-11-02 — latest stable as of the 2026-11-04
# currency pass. The 0.16 -> 0.17 jump removed @cImport and the **
# array-multiplication syntax; bus.zig now gets its C bindings from the
# TranslateC build step (cragd/build.zig). We install the official
# release tarball, sha256-verified, so the pin cannot drift when distro
# repos move to a newer build.
